crass consumerism and banality.

6
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:14,140
(Penny:)And Leonard didn't want
to work with you?

7
00:00:14,140 --> 00:00:15,780
(Penny:)Imagine that.

8
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:17,580
(Sheldon:)I know, it's baffling.

9
00:00:19,360 --> 00:00:22,850
♪ Nobody knows ♪

10
