(Penny:)Do you want some?

13
00:00:29,260 --> 00:00:31,020
(Sheldon:)Do you make it
with milk or water?

14
00:00:31,030 --> 00:00:32,690
(Sheldon:)- Milk.
- Real cocoa?

15
00:00:32,690 --> 00:00:34,760
(Penny:)That's what it says
on the packet.

16
00:00:34,760 --> 00:00:36,960
(Sheldon:)Do you have
those little marshmallows?

17
00:00:36,960 --> 00:00:37,930
(Penny:)No, sorry.

18
00:00:37,930 --> 00:00:40,370
(Sheldon:)Well, I suppose
it's appropriate.

19
00:00:40,370 --> 00:00:41,470
(Penny:)What does that mean?

20
00:00:41,470 --> 00:00:45,270
(Sheldon:)A disappointing drink
for a disappointing day.

21
